{"version":1,"content":"<p>日劇天王堺雅人主演的話題劇《VIVANT》第2季，上周日(8日)迎來大結局，收視破頂錄得21.8%，創下今年播放最高收視日劇紀錄。</p><p>不過，《VIVANT》熱潮未減退，電影版將接力在下月4日上映，今日(11日)更公開首張宣傳海報。</p><p>海報以黑白色調</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T03:11:11.673161+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T01:28:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T03:04:36.761279+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T03:04:36.761279+00:00","content_hash":"2d6aab1e88152a8d7c65e49f889dc7b753c34df908d8def52815ad71b8562222","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}